	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Gr<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>atiam et <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vitae <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>innocen<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>tiam a do<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>min<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>o.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Am<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>icas tu<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>as lit<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>er<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>as<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/><persName ref="p8417">Muscu<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>le</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>pr<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>aestan<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tissi<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>me, 30. <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ma<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>rtii <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>datas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Brief <ref target="file12446">Nr. 2399</ref>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>matur<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>e <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>s<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>a<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>tis <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>per studiosum<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Marx oder Markus [...]: s. <ref target="file12446">Nr. 2399</ref>, Anm. 1 und <ref target="file12450">Nr. 2403</ref>, Anm. 32.</note> collegii nostri accepi, quę et oblectarunt me non <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>mediocriter.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Gratissimum enim id mihi imprimis, quod hoc ipsum certa narratio<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ne contexis, quod certo scire utile quidem, sed ita vagis et vanis rumoribus spargitur, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>ut, quid credas, nescias.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Intellexi ergo ex tuis certo, quibus de causis colloquium illud <lb xml:id="p1z38"/><placeName ref="l410">Ratisbonense</placeName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Das Zweite <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Religionsgespräch; vgl. <ref target="file12446">Nr. 2399</ref>,6-17.</note> dissolutum in fumum et nebulam abierit ac citra fructum etiam, non <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>tamen sine sumptibus maximis<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <ref target="file12423">Nr. 2376</ref>,45f; <ref target="file12471">Nr. 2424</ref>,60-62.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Cuperem ego, ut aliquando finis aliquis talium <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>inveniretur colloquiorum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Toties iam tentata sunt colloquia sine omni fructu, atque <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>utinam pauco cum detrimento ecclesiae!</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Certum est adversarios a colloquiis (quic<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>quid tandem in colloquiis pro sua versutia animadvertant) intollerabilius fero<lb xml:id="p1z43"/>cire quam antea; imo incipiunt nescio quid spirare, quasi nos<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Die Protestanten.</note> nostrae poenitu<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>erit reformationis.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Gloriantur apud suos brevi rem habituram melius.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">In<pb type="scan" next="361v."/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>suspitionem veniunt fratres.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Tentantur et deficiunt animi propemodum nostrorum, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>eorum maxime, qui alias sunt infirmiores.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Firmiores indigne hęc ferunt, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ita ut ex colloquiis illis parum utilitatis redeat ad ecclesiam.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego certe nihil <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ex iis spei concipio, licet brevi sint hisce restauranda et in meliorem form<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>am componenda comitiis<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> convitiis. - <hi>Eine weitere Fehllesung unten Anm. c.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Damit ist der bevorstehende <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Reichstag gemeint; s. <ref target="file12378">Nr. 2331</ref>, Anm. 3.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quibuscum enim colloqui debent nostri, palam <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et ex professo sunt impii et persequtores manifesti et crudelissimi r<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>eligionis nostrae.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Extant atrocia <persName ref="p19981">papae</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p19981">Paul III.</persName></note> et caesaris<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName></note> aedicta<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> denkt an die Maßnahmen gegen die niederländischen Protestanten und gegen <persName ref="p8462">Hermann von Wied</persName>; s. <ref target="file12380">Nr. 2333</ref>,68; <ref target="file12428">Nr. 2381</ref>, Anm. 11; <ref target="file12431">Nr. 2384</ref>, Anm. 3 und Anm. 4. Vgl. ebenfalls <ref target="file12462">Nr. 2415</ref>,103f.</note>: Sunt in conspectu <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>dei et totius mundi funestissima facta.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Qui ab his deputantur, impii sunt, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>pertinaces, Pharaonici<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <ref target="file12448">Nr. 2401</ref>,245f,253-266.</note> et sicut Iamnes et Iambres<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">lambres <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> aus</hi> Mambres <hi>korrigiert; s. schon <ref target="file12448">Nr. 2401</ref>, Anm. k.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><cit type="bible"><ref>2Tim 3, 8</ref></cit>.</note> ad contradicendum tantum <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>compositi, nec aliud cogitant, quam ut sua quovis modo defendant et defendendo <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>nostrorum animos vel frangant vel abstrahant.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Nam id fixum animis <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>tenent, nos esse hęreticos et sibi nullo modo vel latum pilum<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">In Anlehnung an die <placeName ref="l822">deutsche</placeName> Wendung "Haaresbreite" <hi>(Wander</hi> II 226f, Nr. 209. 275. 277) und in Entsprechung zu dem klassischen Ausdruck "latum unguem"; s. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 1, 5, 6 <hi>(ASD</hi> II/1 482-484, <ref target="file10441">Nr. 406</ref>).</note> esse cedendum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Unde apostolus<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Paulus.</note> non sine causa non modo fugere tales, sed aversari praecipit 2. Ti<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>moth. 3, [5]<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Allerdings findet sich an dieser Stelle keine Aufforderung, sich solchen Menschen zu widersetzen.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Non temere dominus Iesus a suis confessionem simplicem <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>evangelii et doctrinam simplicem postulavit.<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Anspielung auf <cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 5, 27</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>10, 16</ref></cit>.</note><pb type="edition" next="371"/></s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Praeterea nihil in re qua<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>libet tam planum et apertum, quod versipellis hominis lingua non queat facere <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>intricatum et obscurum, ut iam non commemorem alia consequentia di<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>sputationis, quae commemorat Paulus 1. Timoth. 6.<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Tim 6, 3-5. 20f</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Video apostolos simpliciter <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>egisse cum adversariis, constanter et plane proposuisse veritatem, <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>rebellantes et blasphaemantes reliquisse.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Metuo ergo, ne, dum nostra sapientia <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>veritatis negotium illustrare volumus, magis obscuremus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominus <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>misereatur nostri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Crudele facinus est, quod narras<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Vgl. <ref target="file12446">Nr. 2399</ref>,18-25.</note> de <persName ref="p4630">Diazio</persName><note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="18"><persName ref="p4630">Alfonso Diaz</persName>, der seinen Bruder <persName ref="p4631">Juan</persName> am 27. März ermordet hatte.</note>, iudice ro<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>tae apostaticae<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Wortspiel mit "rota apostolica"; s. <ref target="file12446">Nr. 2399</ref>, Anm. 15.</note>.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Dignus plane est, qui implicetur rotae iustitiae<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Anspielung auf eine Hinrichtung durch Rädern.</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Factum hic <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>est, quod olim in exordio mundi, cum Abelem conficeret Cain, frater fratrem<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Siehe <cit type="bible"><ref>Gen 4, 1-15</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z25"/>Specimina haec sunt.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Quid expectemus a huiusmodi hominibus, qui consilia colligunt<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 21 (Vulg. 20), 12</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>94 (Vulg. 93), 211</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>140 (Vulg. 139), 3</ref></cit>; usw.</note> <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>et ad colloquia convolant?</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Vigilemus et oremus<note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><cit type="bible"><ref>Mt 26, 41 par</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Nulla apud nos <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>sunt nova, nisi quod <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName> comitia celebrarunt <placeName ref="l21">Badenę</placeName><note xml:id="fn24" type="footnote" n="24">Zu der <placeName ref="l862">eidgenössischen</placeName> Tagsatzung vom 12. April s. <ref target="file12374">Nr. 2327</ref>, Anm. 28; <ref target="file12454">Nr. 2407</ref>, Anm. 36; <ref target="file12471">Nr. 2424</ref>,77-81.</note> maxime <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>propter foedus Schmalkaldiense.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Misit id legationem<note xml:id="fn25" type="footnote" n="25">Die <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> <persName ref="p5856">Matthäus Molckenpur</persName> und <persName ref="p5245">Dominik Hochrütiner</persName>; s. oben <ref target="file12460">Nr. 2413</ref>,49-53.</note> ad eos admonens, <lb xml:id="p2z29"/>ne transitum in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> per <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> concedant exercitui peregrino, <lb xml:id="p2z30"/><placeName ref="l834">Italico</placeName> aut <placeName ref="l875">Hispanico</placeName>, si quis forte transire tentaret.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Amicissime respon<lb xml:id="p2z31"/>sum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">In der Vorlage rursum.</note> est a nostris<note xml:id="fn26" type="footnote" n="26">Allerdings nur vonseiten der protestantischen Stadtkantone.</note> <placeName ref="l862">Helvetiam</placeName> <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> favere, agere denique gratias pro ad<lb xml:id="p2z32"/>monitione et semper incolumitatem <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> curaturos, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>dilecte mi frater, et <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName><note xml:id="fn27" type="footnote" n="27"><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName>.</note> nostrum commendatum tibi habe, qui bene<lb xml:id="p2z34"/>volentiam tuam valde mihi praedicavit postremis suis literis,<note xml:id="fn28" type="footnote" n="28">Eine offensichtliche Übertreibung, zumal alle Briefe <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> an <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> für die unmittelbar vorangegangene Zeit erhalten sind, <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Briefe vom 14. April (<ref target="file12469">Nr. 2422</ref>) und 1. April (<ref target="file12453">Nr. 2406</ref>) <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> nicht erwähnen und die Anspielung auf <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> in <persName ref="p8018">Hallers</persName> Brief vom 23. März (<ref target="file12436">Nr. 2389</ref>,60f) längst nicht so lobend ausfällt, wie dies hier behauptet wird.</note> pro qua re ma<lb xml:id="p2z35"/>gnas tibi gratias ago.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>, 22. aprilis 1546.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis <lb xml:id="p2z36"/>amicissime d. Peutingeros,<note xml:id="fn29" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="29"><persName ref="p6076">Konrad Peutinger</persName> und dessen Sohn <persName ref="p2449">Claudius Pius Peutinger</persName>.</note> dominos semper colendos, et omnes fratres atque fautores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuu<lb xml:id="p2z37"/>s.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse als Überschrift von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8417">Musculo</persName> suo, <placeName ref="l18">Augu<lb xml:id="p2z38"/>stano</placeName> ecclesiastae, <persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
